<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Sweden to auction 5 bln SKR 6-month bills.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sweden to auction 5 bln SKR 6-month bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would auction five billion crowns ($630 million) worth of six-month treasury bills.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 1030 GMT on the day of the auction.</p>
<p>						190-day bill</p>
<p> Maturity date			    Feb 18, 1998</p>
<p> Volume to market (Billions Skr)    5.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			  August 8</p>
<p> Auction date			     August 6</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003 ($ = 7.935 Swedish Crowns)</p>
